Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.12,0:01:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The... The Dr. Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.70,0:01:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.33,0:01:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scream about it,\Nwhy don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.62,0:01:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm your biggest fan.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.16,0:01:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to meet\Nyou for so long.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.30,0:01:47.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You taught me so much.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.97,0:01:51.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I spent two years\Nat your lab in Baltimore.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.94,0:01:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I studied everything I\Ncould get my hands on.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.59,0:01:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.17,0:01:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got to see\Nthe stuff I made.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a dream come true!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.35,0:02:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, oh boy, oh boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.08,0:02:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A giant robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.82,0:02:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like General Franky,\Nbut a bajillion times bigger!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.71,0:02:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish Luffy and Chopper\Nwere here to see it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.15,0:02:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk is a total babe!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might I take a look\Nat your panties, please?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.06,0:02:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giant robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.48,0:02:30.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.10,0:02:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there something\Nwrong, Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.88,0:02:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never heard that\NVegapunk was a woman.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.92,0:02:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A young one, no less.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.30,0:02:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You filthy pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Obviously I'm not the Stella!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.05,0:02:43.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Stella?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.62,0:02:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Punk, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk Lilith, the evil!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.89,0:02:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.47,0:02:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, our budget's\Ngone down the test tube.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.62,0:03:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So hand over your valuables.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.26,0:03:03.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'll consider\Nour business complete.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.53,0:03:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You expect us to head right\Nback into that snowstorm?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.21,0:03:08.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saved us from drowning!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.86,0:03:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So follow through, dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to save you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.31,0:03:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And don't you even think about\Ntrying to sail any further!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.58,0:03:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have iron-tight defenses\Ntrained to attack all ships.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.25,0:03:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I call them...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.17,0:03:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the sea beast weapons!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.93,0:03:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are those guys\Ngiant robots, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.16,0:03:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.54,0:03:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, now I'm scared again!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.74,0:03:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect me, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.06,0:03:56.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From now on, you play\Nby my rules or get sunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So move it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuck over your treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.84,0:04:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.54,0:04:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lilith, what are you\Ndoing out there?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.36,0:04:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same thing as always, Shaka!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.97,0:04:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you calling me?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you plundering again?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.69,0:04:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is your pride\Nas a scientist?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.15,0:04:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pride don't pay the bills\Nin case you didn't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.80,0:04:20.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is she talking to?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.53,0:04:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's the view from\Nthat high horse?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.63,0:04:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are the Straw\NHat Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.48,0:04:26.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not going\Nto surrender.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.57,0:04:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their captain just became\Nan Emperor of the Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And c is for cash!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.58,0:04:35.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I steal from an Emperor, think\Nof all the research funding I can nab!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.50,0:04:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you've made\Na miscalculation.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.75,0:04:39.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.81,0:04:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I surrounded them\Nwith sea beasts.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.49,0:04:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.93,0:04:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hear that, dimwits?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're underestimating them.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.91,0:04:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Look at the swordsman\Non the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.65,0:04:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He has a bounty of one billion, one\Nhundred and eleven million berries.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.03,0:04:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Pirate Hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.47,0:04:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Notice how calm he is?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.18,0:05:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's because he knows he can kill\Nyou in an instant from that range.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.06,0:05:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The same could be said\Nfor Demon Child Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's standing\Nright behind him.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.75,0:05:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there's no way they could win\Nagainst this many sea beast weapons!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't have to.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.63,0:05:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The strong can determine\Nthe highest priority target.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.73,0:05:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In this case, that's you.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what are those\Ndotes then?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.04,0:05:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Decoys?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.58,0:05:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crafty bastards.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.91,0:05:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.18,0:05:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From now on, you\Nplay by our rules.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.27,0:05:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or you're sunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.19,0:05:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a threat?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.34,0:05:33.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know who\Nyou're talking to?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.37,0:05:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring them in so\Nwe can speak.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I happen to have\Nan interest in that crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.60,0:05:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said you've been\Non this island before, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.14,0:05:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I came here when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was just a regular lab then.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.51,0:05:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glad you come back.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must be real important.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.50,0:05:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said you had\Nbusiness with Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.07,0:05:58.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're damn right I do.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.84,0:06:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if I can't settle it,\NI'll kill him!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.95,0:06:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.52,0:06:06.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did he do wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.12,0:06:12.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Years ago, Vegapunk turned\Nmy father into a cyborg.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.82,0:06:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a cyborg?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.14,0:06:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.03,0:06:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.37,0:06:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My father had all sense\Nof self ripped away from him.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.46,0:06:24.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even know\Nwho he is anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.60,0:06:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He became nothing more\Nthan a living weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a horrific fate.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.98,0:06:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My condolences.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.93,0:06:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll pay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.86,0:06:36.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.70,0:06:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, boggy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.91,0:06:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.28,0:06:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry again!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.74,0:06:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just keep moving, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.30,0:06:48.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This should get\Nus to the surface.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.24,0:06:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey look!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can see the exit!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A future island!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I see in my future\Nis food, food, food!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.58,0:07:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's find\Nsome snacks and...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.91,0:07:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.72,0:07:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see something cool?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.25,0:07:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.41,0:07:22.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Probably should have told him\NI saw Sabo at Mary Geoise.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.16,0:07:23.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a giant robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is quite a sight.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a space monster?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.56,0:07:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And look at all\Nthe stuff in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.68,0:07:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.56,0:07:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ride on the red guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.18,0:08:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, let's be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.53,0:08:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to keep\Na low profile, stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.60,0:08:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.85,0:08:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.29,0:08:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.21,0:08:30.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought the lizard ate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm putting down.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.75,0:08:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Food!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.11,0:08:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fruit and cookies!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.61,0:08:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.32,0:08:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.56,0:08:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It could be a trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.72,0:08:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lizard! Lizard! Lizard!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.91,0:09:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why can't I eat this stuff?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.55,0:09:12.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me eat you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.57,0:09:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.19,0:09:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.11,0:09:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I figured it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.48,0:09:23.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.73,0:09:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't touch it\Nbecause we're dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,941)}You think we're ghosts?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.81,0:09:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.93,0:09:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.29,0:09:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm already dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.18,0:09:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem\Nlikely to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.98,0:09:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then why do I go\Nthrough the food?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're the ones\Nwho are immaterial.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me try something.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.59,0:09:48.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not so.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.64,0:09:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this parfait\Nis only a hologram.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A holo-holo?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.51,0:09:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,227)}Why are they\Nmessing with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.76,0:10:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no idea why they'd want\Nto litter the streets with fake food.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.55,0:10:03.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm not exactly\Nan expert on holograms.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I hate them!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're mean!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their image is\Nproduced by light.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you seen this kind\Nof stuff in a comic before?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Sci-Fi.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That must be why I went\Nstraight through that monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.00,0:10:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The giant robot must\Nbe a hologram, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.53,0:10:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one could make\None that big.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.47,0:10:23.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.34,0:10:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.16,0:10:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's pictures of food\Non all the buttons!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.04,0:10:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's probably fake\Nlike everything else.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give it up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island sucks.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.44,0:10:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something else is\Nstrange about this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.68,0:10:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just a short while ago,\Nwe were all freezing.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.03,0:10:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But since we've arrived here,\Nit's been quite warm.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.14,0:10:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's 'cause I set\Nthe climate to tropical.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.16,0:10:50.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta get crafty when you\Nlive on a winter island.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.28,0:10:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I invented the island ac so\Nwe could stay nice and cozy.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can control the temperature\Nof this whole island.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heat comes\Nfrom the ground.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.62,0:11:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,\Nyou bastards are new.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.62,0:11:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.03,0:11:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's bigger than Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.12,0:11:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I don't have time to chat,\Nso you guys stay out of trouble,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.13,0:11:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,whoever you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.37,0:11:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to work,\Nso I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Step aside, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.36,0:11:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet you made\Nthat fake parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.29,0:11:24.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm starving to death here!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.84,0:11:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea\Ntricking me like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.41,0:11:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, if you're hungry, I can...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you a ball\Nof ham, too, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.16,0:11:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I hit her!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.38,0:11:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is she real?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.52,0:11:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I real?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.84,0:11:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm real.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Real pissed off!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.75,0:11:42.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.05,0:11:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She is real,\Nand she killed Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.94,0:11:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.74,0:12:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.62,0:12:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This texture, this smell...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.26,0:12:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A real hamburger with real\Nfries and a real drink!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.07,0:12:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then it's not a holo-gram!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.35,0:12:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's real!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.09,0:12:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.58,0:12:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.92,0:12:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the real deal!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.84,0:12:31.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.35,0:12:34.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who made all of this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.47,0:12:35.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It came out of the thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.99,0:12:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think there's\Nsomeone in there?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.87,0:12:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He just hit a button\Nand food popped out!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then what the hell\Nare we waiting for?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.04,0:12:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's start pushing\Nsome buttons!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.48,0:12:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.53,0:12:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ooh, steak!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.94,0:12:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eggs and a pork cutlet!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.62,0:12:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.36,0:12:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do desserts!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.58,0:12:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, pizza!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.50,0:12:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what I want!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.68,0:12:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen, fried chicken,\Nand a hot dog!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.56,0:13:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, press them all at once\Nso they come out faster!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.39,0:13:01.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, nice thinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.80,0:13:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.59,0:13:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper's a genius!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.83,0:13:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flattery doesn't make\Nme happy, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.22,0:13:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatcha want, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.50,0:13:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.56,0:13:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.42,0:13:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure eat a lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.50,0:13:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I was hungry.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.97,0:13:22.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you're eating\Nas much as me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.84,0:13:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was hungry, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.40,0:13:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I was, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like my invention\Nis a big hit.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.84,0:13:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What am I looking at?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.23,0:13:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.65,0:13:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're curious, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.64,0:13:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Behold my auto-cooking\Nmachine!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.99,0:13:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as there are enough ingredients, it\Ncan prepare 500 different dishes per minute!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.16,0:13:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It even has a Whip\NUp Leftovers mode.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna change the world!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.74,0:13:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or it would change the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can mass produce it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.60,0:13:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(435,0)}But no, we don't have the budget\Nto hire technicians for that!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.08,0:14:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same with the island A.c.!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.63,0:14:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We could use its temperature\Ntechnology to track everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.84,0:14:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone on the island,\Nbut we don't have the money!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.34,0:14:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every damn day, I build\Nworld-shattering new inventions!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.64,0:14:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And every damn day,\NI get screwed by budget cuts!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I had the money,\NI could do anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even control the weather!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.02,0:14:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world needs my technology,\Nand I need cash!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.17,0:14:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm doing my part,\Nwhy can't they do theirs?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.84,0:14:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It makes me so...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.14,0:14:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's my freaking\Nminutes?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.86,0:14:36.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.72,0:14:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She punched a hologram?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.03,0:14:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right trip, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.32,0:14:40.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It waffles!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.36,0:14:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm better now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.43,0:14:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you\Npunch that thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought everything\Nhere was a hologram.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.56,0:14:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still curious?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then listen closely!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.88,0:15:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With these light pressure gloves,\NI can do more than just observe holograms!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.09,0:15:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.79,0:15:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happens when\Nsomeone touches an object?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.26,0:15:08.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They perceive it as\Nreal, don't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.30,0:15:09.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So she's not real?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.50,0:15:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.30,0:15:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall we find out?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, watch out!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.35,0:15:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She wasn't real after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.52,0:15:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what can kill\Nme and what can't anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.26,0:15:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What decides if she's real?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.92,0:15:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If anything is.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.32,0:15:30.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's for you\Nto determine on your own.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.62,0:15:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rigid thinking needs\Nto become a thing of the past!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I say!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.81,0:15:36.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's still inside me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.65,0:15:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should have asked\Nsooner, but who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.45,0:15:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.61,0:15:47.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a humble,\Ngenius scientist for hire!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.86,0:15:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor... Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.72,0:16:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Doctor Vegapunk?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby told me about you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How come you're\Na giant kid?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.15,0:16:11.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is\Nthis liar talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.34,0:16:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, what's our next move?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.88,0:16:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's what we know.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.38,0:16:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's only one man\Nwith a mind like Vegapunk's.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.19,0:16:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And a genius like that\Nalways has a full plate.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.27,0:16:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, he could use some help\Nwith his work, but no one else can keep up.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.29,0:16:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With that thought in mind,\Nhe had an idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.77,0:16:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if he split himself\Ninto six different people?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.76,0:16:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those offshoots\Nare called satellites.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The satellites function\Nas their own individuals.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.81,0:16:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But at the end of the day,\Nthey're all Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.11,0:16:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you weren't the one telling me,\NI'd say this was too insane to be true.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six geniuses.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will be a pain.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.99,0:16:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So we make\Nour way to Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.10,0:16:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We tell them we're\Nreturning this.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And once we're in, we\Nkill all of the Vegapunks.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.21,0:17:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes, but his lab's full\Nof priceless research.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.87,0:17:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's try to keep\Nthe damage to a minimum.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.03,0:17:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They want us to eliminate\Nthe most useful man in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.83,0:17:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does this have something\Nto do with Lulusia?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.53,0:17:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Considering\Nthe timing, it must.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.73,0:17:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lulusia, you're a smart boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.10,0:17:21.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should know better than\Nto be nosy about these things.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.35,0:17:22.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to her, Lucci.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trouble for you means\Ntrouble for all of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.14,0:17:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let it go.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.93,0:17:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was so good.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.47,0:17:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad everyone\Nelse missed out.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.66,0:17:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to eat again.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.30,0:17:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to show\Nthem the food machine.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna love it for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, Sanji might\Nnot be too happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.63,0:17:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure made a big mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.42,0:17:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And those bellies, they look\Nlike they're about to burst.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.27,0:17:47.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I always look like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.64,0:17:55.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta work.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.95,0:17:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.17,0:17:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's your job?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.27,0:18:00.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, just\Nviolence and stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.60,0:18:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.25,0:18:20.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are those robots, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.02,0:18:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is a lab, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.06,0:18:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My guess is that\Nthey're researchers.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.90,0:18:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There wasn't anyone in town at first,\Nbut now there's a whole crowd.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.58,0:18:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now on.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.66,0:18:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they were waiting\Nto see if we posed a threat.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.70,0:18:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their clothes look so heavy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.31,0:18:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't they too hot\Nin this weather?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.65,0:18:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.34,0:18:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd Luffy go?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.36,0:18:44.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounded\Nlike Luffy's voice.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.74,0:18:45.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.30,0:18:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me my hat back!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.61,0:18:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's he doing in there?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.97,0:18:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.36,0:18:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.43,0:18:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.22,0:19:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love how this feels.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.87,0:19:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks kind of heavy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's actually not at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.56,0:19:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's cool inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.06,0:19:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look quite nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.60,0:19:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want one.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.37,0:19:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got the clothes in there?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.89,0:19:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on in.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.30,0:19:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Free food and free clothes?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.04,0:19:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The future is so handy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.70,0:19:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do feel a little sticky\Nthanks to that sea water.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.66,0:19:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please choose\Nyour preferred clothing style.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.73,0:19:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.71,0:19:38.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can get dressed\Nmyself, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.42,0:19:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.20,0:19:46.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,right.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.07,0:19:48.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm as light as a feather.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.60,0:19:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm floating\Nin these shoes.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.33,0:19:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.18,0:19:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The future.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.02,0:19:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they had\Nsomething tropical, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.83,0:19:57.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.78,0:20:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look amazing, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.19,0:20:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.68,0:20:01.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hopefully this will\Nhelp us blend in.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.37,0:20:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although it might\Nbe too late for that.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.82,0:20:08.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go\Nand look for a weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going to try\Nto find Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.42,0:20:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm off.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.74,0:20:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.64,0:20:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay safe out there, Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.05,0:20:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.88,0:20:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.58,0:20:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Kuma.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.94,0:20:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.67,0:20:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It could be trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.35,0:20:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he looking for us?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.90,0:20:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.68,0:20:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.63,0:20:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta run for it, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.14,0:20:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's definitely coming for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.97,0:20:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.39,0:20:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me who we're\Nrunning away from and why?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.40,0:20:55.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Later, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.33,0:20:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.66,0:21:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aggravated theft\Nof food and clothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.52,0:21:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.07,0:21:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thing didn't\Nask for money!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.66,0:21:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It worked when I hit it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.01,0:21:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds like\Nvandalism to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.25,0:21:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.23,0:21:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's trying to kill us!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.69,0:21:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The law here is quite harsh.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.72,0:21:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's going all out!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.37,0:21:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta fight back!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.55,0:21:50.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, we may be pirates,\Nbut self-defense is self-defense!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.17,0:21:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kuma!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.92,0:21:53.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.50,0:21:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.82,0:21:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.60,0:22:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.16,0:22:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.68,0:22:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.17,0:22:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.70,0:22:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your deal, Bonney?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.41,0:22:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's using lasers on us!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I at least hit him?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.09,0:22:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's my father.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.14,0:22:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's all I've got.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.31,0:23:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the only family I have.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.74,0:23:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you said your dad\Ngot turned into a cyborg...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.64,0:23:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were talking\Nabout Kuma?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.42,0:23:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't his fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.26,0:23:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So don't hurt my father,\NI'm begging you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.47,0:23:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run away, you dummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.95,0:23:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a pacifista!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.60,0:23:44.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.86,0:23:45.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.80,0:24:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Close valve two, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.23,0:24:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need cover here!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.03,0:24:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.35,0:24:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see something dead ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.31,0:24:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn now!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.24,0:24:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.77,0:24:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.07,0:24:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come out and fight me!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.67,0:24:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't take another hit!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.18,0:24:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The water pressure's\Ngonna crush the sub!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.21,0:24:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain, you gotta\Nmake the call!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.38,0:25:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's surface.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.50,0:25:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the northeast, near land!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.18,0:25:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.28,0:25:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to starboard!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.70,0:25:17.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone get ready to fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.31,0:25:18.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.03,0:25:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.80,0:25:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must be a devil fruit power.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.82,0:25:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in their trap.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.22,0:25:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.30,0:25:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I, cutie.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.58,0:25:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.74,0:25:32.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't shut\Nyour mouths, I'll gut you!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.96,0:25:34.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're cute when\Nyou're mad, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.86,0:25:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.78,0:25:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been girlified!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.24,0:25:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's spreading\Nto the entire crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.44,0:25:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then stay away\Nfrom the infected!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.59,0:25:46.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.61,0:25:49.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's functioning like\Na contagious disease.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.99,0:25:51.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are they\Nchanging our sex?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.88,0:25:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.12,0:25:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I learned something\Nfighting an Emperor.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.16,0:26:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can break through this!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.07,0:26:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You intensify your haki!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.04,0:26:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It nullifies devil fruit powers!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.61,0:26:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've reached\Nthe surface, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.42,0:26:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.19,0:26:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.31,0:26:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no power\Nyou can't beat!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.84,0:26:32.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can celebrate when\Nwe've won this fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.03,0:26:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor Sub,\Nwe're going ashore!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.18,0:26:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.44,0:26:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems he cured\Nthe disease already.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.52,0:26:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's worth three billion\Nfor a reason, I suppose.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.48,0:26:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Handy trick.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.52,0:26:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as he broke through the illness,\Nhis antibodies spread as quickly
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.63,0:26:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as the contagion.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.07,0:26:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it was fun while it lasted.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.12,0:27:00.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My feminization disease.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.19,0:27:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burgess, I'll move\Nus to the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.29,0:27:10.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.07,0:27:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.77,0:27:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that mountain moving?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.65,0:27:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's someone lifting it off!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.63,0:27:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grr.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.85,0:27:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.77,0:27:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is true power!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.13,0:27:43.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the\NStrong-Strong Fruit!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.28,0:27:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that Burgess?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.12,0:27:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.16,0:27:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can just toss around\Nwhole mountains now?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.46,0:27:53.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And how did he manage to get\Nto the shore so quickly?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.61,0:27:55.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're using Devil\NFruit powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.01,0:27:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teleportation, contagion,\Nsuperhuman strength.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.81,0:28:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must have gained these\Nby hunting for specific abilities.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.05,0:28:05.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see why their bounties\Nkeep rising.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.32,0:28:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Room!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.64,0:29:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a while,\Nhasn't it, Trafalgar Law?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.00,0:29:02.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this, Blackbeard?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.79,0:29:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you want from us?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.08,0:29:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.52,0:29:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're both in the worst\Ngeneration, aren't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.16,0:29:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Commodore!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.06,0:29:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stronger says you're\Na bit too heavy.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.79,0:29:27.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew someone would be\Ncoming through here from Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.32,0:29:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure if it would be you,\NStraw Hat, or Kid, but that's fine,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.12,0:29:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not picky.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.72,0:29:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you took\Nout Kaido and Big Bob.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You turned the whole\Nworld upside down.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.31,0:29:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feels good, don't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.94,0:29:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet you got a fine\Ntreasure from Kaido, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.53,0:29:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many Road Poneglyphs\Ndo you have now?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.28,0:29:56.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to find out,\Ncause soon they'll all be mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.97,0:30:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could say the same to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.04,0:30:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.27,0:30:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Winner takes all!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.81,0:28:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,109)}Amputate!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.48,0:16:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.03,0:29:19.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I feel the same...-OG}{WF}And I agree!
